<title>Overview of differentiation exam</title>
  <p>The differentiation exam consists of 6 problems.  Each problem is on its own page.  You can switch pages with the Previous and Next buttons.</p>

  <p>This practice differentiation exam is nearly identical to the actual differentiation exam.  For each attempt, problems are randomly selected from a pool of questions.  The actual differentiation exam, however, will not give you the solution, show any hints or feedback, or indicate whether or not your response is correct.</p>

  <p>When you are done, click the Finish Assessment button.</p>
 